    "turn_text": "Listen, thank you. I know you're a busy, busy man. And a bit of a disappointing one today, it sounds like a skiff has been arranged. I've seen some comments, we've all seen comments on social media. Can you talk about what your hopes were going into the skiff today and why ultimately you seem to have come out disappointed?",
