    "turn_idx": 20,
    "turn_text": "Absolutely. You know, since 1947, they've told us these things don't exist. And then now they tell us they do exist. And then now nobody can tell us where we can look to see if they see where they exist. You know, it's just a It's like peeling off the layers of an onion, you get down and you get another layer. I",
